"Keiko Velra is an A-rank Chainer and has been a superhero in Tokyo for fifteen years."
"She is Aimi Velra's younger sister and the rogue of the Velra family."
"She bucked the family's private schooling and went to superhero school with Hannah and Cly Zhao."
"She and Hannah Elber were classmates but didn't really mesh."
"She moved to the other side of the planet to get away from her family."
"Besides the oldest Velras, she is the only one of the family to live off Anesidora."
"Her family treats her hero work as a hobby."
"She is secretive about her skills, spells and wordchains."
"She looks like Aimi, but with a bob haircut and the start of crow's feet."
"She takes her coffee with hazelnut creamer."
"She long ago mastered giving the System mental commands."
"While Glossed she accidentally busted a gang of human traffickers on her way to coffee."
"A one-hour summons while Glossed rewarded her with a new wordchain she hadn't earned."
"She found Alden Thorn's name by searching the Body Drainer incident."
"She texted and video-called Alden to broker the Velra class trade."
"She has goals of her own that the Gloss backlash may ruin."
